    <fr:title text="Agda-based generative music system">Agda-based generative music system</fr:title>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>Define inductive types that encode musical structure---chord progressions, rhythmic patterns, harmonic transitions. Use dependent types to guarantee valid compositions. Implement weighted random sampling over valid constructors to generate music that satisfies constraints by construction. Postulate a randomness interface in Agda and implement it in Haskell with different backends---seeded PRNGs for determinism or real-time feature-based sampling.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
